<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Holiday silences after-hours market.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Holiday silences after-hours market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Traders said the start of the Labor Day long weekend brought the after-hours market to a halt.</p>
<p>There was no significant volume, they said. Earlier in the day, NationsBank Corp said it would acquire Boatmen's Bancshares Inc if a $9.5 billion merger deal.</p>
<p>NationsBank shares slid 7-1/4 to close at 85-1/8, while Boatmen's shares soared up 10-5/16 to close at 53-1/4.</p>
</text>
